CALL mh XRemoveEffectFromPlayer Nola_DownedBlock
LOG NOLA LIFE: pawn novo de pe: efeito Nola_DownedBlock retirado por garantia (save feito caido) ok=true
CALL me RD dmg=30.00 bone=None
LOG NOLA dmgin: seq=1 pedido=30.0 aplicado=30.0 hp 100.0 -> 70.0 ok=true 
OUT me hp=70.0 alive=true
CALL build XSetEntityUnkillableByUID 7 true
CALL gm_keep 1
LOG NOLA LIFE: GameManager god off agora poupa o bit 0x2 do jogador (ok=true)
LOG NOLA testgod: LIGADO uid=7: Unkillable + hp de volta ao maximo a cada tick, dano roteado e queda ignorados
CALL me ForceSetHP 100
LOG NOLA testgod: hp 70.0 -> 100.0 (recarga #1)
OUT me hp=100.0 alive=true
OUT god_held=true bit=true
CALL me ForceSetHP 100
LOG NOLA testgod: hp 5.0 -> 100.0 (recarga #2)
OUT me hp=100.0 alive=true
OUT #L:a,100,100
LOG NOLA testgod: dano roteado seq=2 (40.0) ignorado (#1)
OUT me hp=100.0 alive=true
CALL me ForceSetHP 100
LOG NOLA testgod: hp 0.0 -> 100.0 (recarga #3)
OUT me hp=100.0 alive=true
CALL me ForceSetHP 100
LOG NOLA testgod: hp 5.0 -> 100.0 (recarga #4)
OUT me hp=100.0 alive=true
OUT #L:a,100,100
CALL build XSetEntityUnkillableByUID 7 false
CALL gm_keep 0
LOG NOLA LIFE: GameManager god off volta a limpar o bit 0x2 do jogador (ok=true)
LOG NOLA testgod: DESLIGADO uid=7 (testgod 0) ok=true; 4 recargas, 1 danos roteados ignorados
OUT god_held=false bit=false
OUT me hp=50.0 alive=true
CALL me RD dmg=20.00 bone=None
LOG NOLA dmgin: seq=3 pedido=20.0 aplicado=20.0 hp 50.0 -> 30.0 ok=true 
OUT me hp=30.0 alive=true
CALL me ForceSetHP 15
CALL me.cm DisableMovement
LOG NOLA LIFE: CAIDO #1 (hp 5.0 <= 15); levanta em 30 s ou com o outro jogador a 300 cm por 3 s
CALL rk XApplyEffectOnPlayer Nola_DownedBlock
LOG NOLA LIFE: caido sem armas: efeito Nola_DownedBlock aplicado (atirar, mirar, recarregar, granada, faca, consumiveis, mochila bloqueados) ok=true
OUT me hp=15.0 alive=true
